{
 "duration": 62.380408,
 "frames": 1871,
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "In eighteen seventy-six,",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 1.651
  },
  {
   "text": "it rained meat in Kentucky.",
   "start": 1.891,
   "end": 3.902
  },
  {
   "text": "March third.",
   "start": 4.804,
   "end": 5.532
  },
  {
   "text": "Bath County.",
   "start": 6.019,
   "end": 6.68
  },
  {
   "text": "A clear,",
   "start": 7.172,
   "end": 7.795
  },
  {
   "text": "sunny sky.",
   "start": 7.795,
   "end": 8.731
  },
  {
   "text": "Mrs.",
   "start": 9.252,
   "end": 9.53
  },
  {
   "text": "Crouch was outside making soap,",
   "start": 9.53,
   "end": 11.478
  },
  {
   "text": "when something fell next to her.",
   "start": 11.669,
   "end": 13.26
  },
  {
   "text": "Then another.",
   "start": 13.725,
   "end": 14.336
  },
  {
   "text": "Then hundreds.",
   "start": 14.835,
   "end": 15.82
  },
  {
   "text": "Pieces of meat.",
   "start": 16.345,
   "end": 17.531
  },
  {
   "text": "Fresh,",
   "start": 17.914,
   "end": 18.441
  },
  {
   "text": "red meat.",
   "start": 18.441,
   "end": 19.496
  },
  {
   "text": "Falling out of a cloudless sky.",
   "start": 19.874,
   "end": 21.893
  },
  {
   "text": "They covered a field about the size of a football field.",
   "start": 22.444,
   "end": 25.209
  },
  {
   "text": "The neighbors came running.",
   "start": 25.645,
   "end": 26.964
  },
  {
   "text": "And two brave men had an idea.",
   "start": 27.365,
   "end": 29.404
  },
  {
   "text": "They ate it.",
   "start": 29.98,
   "end": 30.689
  },
  {
   "text": "One said it tasted like mutton.",
   "start": 31.224,
   "end": 32.841
  },
  {
   "text": "The other said venison.",
   "start": 33.241,
   "end": 34.469
  },
  {
   "text": "Scientists got samples.",
   "start": 34.971,
   "end": 36.498
  },
  {
   "text": "One said it was lung.",
   "start": 36.855,
   "end": 38.045
  },
  {
   "text": "Another said it was algae.",
   "start": 38.362,
   "end": 39.663
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody agreed.",
   "start": 40.118,
   "end": 41.14
  },
  {
   "text": "So where did it come from?",
   "start": 41.662,
   "end": 43.253
  },
  {
   "text": "You see,",
   "start": 43.859,
   "end": 44.217
  },
  {
   "text": "vultures fly in big flocks.",
   "start": 44.437,
   "end": 46.581
  },
  {
   "text": "And when a vulture gets scared\u2026 it throws up.",
   "start": 46.879,
   "end": 49.617
  },
  {
   "text": "So the best guess,",
   "start": 50.094,
   "end": 51.163
  },
  {
   "text": "even today,",
   "start": 51.163,
   "end": 52.233
  },
  {
   "text": "is a flock of vultures,",
   "start": 52.466,
   "end": 53.882
  },
  {
   "text": "all getting sick at once.",
   "start": 54.096,
   "end": 55.572
  },
  {
   "text": "Which means those two men had lunch\u2026 straight from a vulture's stomach.",
   "start": 56.05,
   "end": 60.619
  }
 ]
}